No 2-torsion: after x=X+t^2+s, cubic is X^3+3(t^2+s)X^2-3btX+3b^2/4.
A rational root must be polynomial of degree<=2. Its leading coefficient is0 or-3. Coefficient comparison forces X=0 or X=-3(t^2+s), neither a root when b!=0. Thus row45 applies.
